// 289's Draynor Manor (quests/quest_haunted/configs/quest_haunted.loc) on
// 2011's locs, matched by where cache 786's maps (l48_52, l48_152) place them.
// Examines moved here from examine.loc.
//
// The basement's lever puzzle is per player in 2011. Levers A-F (146-151, as
// 289's) are multilocs on varbits 1788-1793, bits 1-6 of varp 33 (289's
// ernestlever, which used bits 0-5), so lever_index is 289's plus one. The
// nine doors are multilocs on varbits 1794-1802, bits 0-8 of varp 668: at 0 a
// door with no ops, at 1 one with Open. 289's doors map onto them in id order,
// and haunted_door_bit is each one's bit.

[loc_146]
desc=I wonder what this does...
category=haunted_lever
param=lever_index,1

[loc_147]
desc=I wonder what this does...
category=haunted_lever
param=lever_index,2

